---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaStrip from '../components/CtaStrip.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Lozen Advisory | Founded by Akilah E. Kamaria"
  description="Founded by data analyst, entrepreneur, and United States Marine Corps veteran Akilah E. Kamaria. Lozen Advisory identifies structural blind spots, disclosure dependency, and risk inside corporate data."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="grid-bg"></div>
    <div class="wrap inner">
      <div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; About</div>
      <span class="pill">Founder &amp; advisory</span>
      <h1>Built to see what institutional data leaves out</h1>
      <p class="sub">Lozen Advisory was founded by Akilah E. Kamaria, a data analyst, entrepreneur, and United States Marine Corps veteran whose work centers on the structural blind spots, disclosure dependency, and risks inside corporate data.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="main">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div class="prose reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
        <h2 class="h2">A founder-led advisory built around what the record cannot prove</h2>
        <p>Akilah E. Kamaria built a career turning data into decisions that moved billions of dollars inside some of the most demanding institutions in the world. That work required more than precision. It required the ability to see past what numbers confirm and press into what they obscure.</p>
        <p>Lozen Advisory grew from that discipline. The firm examines the structural conditions, accountability gaps, and disclosure-dependent systems that can leave organizations unable to see risk until it has already become consequential.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="checklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
          <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Data analysis supporting decisions at institutional scale</p></div>
          <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>United States Marine Corps veteran</p></div>
          <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Research contribution on race and gender discrimination</p></div>
          <div class="check"><span class="ck">✓</span><p>Foundational work on cybersecurity information-sharing standards</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="center section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">What we believe</span>
        <h2 class="h2">Our values</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="values">
        <div class="value reveal">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Precision over assumption</h3>
          <p>We separate what the record establishes from what institutions merely believe to be true.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value reveal">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Structures before symptoms</h3>
          <p>We look beyond individual behavior to the systems, incentives, and measurement conditions producing the exposure.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="value reveal">
          <div class="ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
              <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Build what is missing</h3>
          <p>When existing language or systems cannot describe the problem clearly, we create the framework needed to make it visible.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="center section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our journey</span>
        <h2 class="h2">How we got here</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="tl reveal">
          <div class="yr">Institutional career</div>
          <h3>Turning data into decisions</h3>
          <p>Akilah built her career using data to support decisions at scale inside demanding institutions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tl reveal">
          <div class="yr">Research &amp; standards</div>
          <h3>Following what systems obscure</h3>
          <p>Her work included research on race and gender discrimination and foundational contributions to cybersecurity information-sharing standards.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tl reveal">
          <div class="yr">2005</div>
          <h3>Building when the market had no answer</h3>
          <p>She founded Hemancipation, a Beverly Hills-based concierge service for men in transition, later featured in Newsweek.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tl reveal">
          <div class="yr">2025</div>
          <h3>Founding Lozen Advisory</h3>
          <p>Lozen Advisory was created to identify and address the structural blind spots, disclosure dependency, and institutional risks conventional systems fail to measure.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="center section-head"><span class="eyebrow">The team</span><h2 class="h2">People who do this every day</h2></div>
      <div class="team">
        <div class="member reveal"><div class="av"><img src="/founder-daniel-carter.png" alt="Daniel Carter" /></div><div class="nm">Daniel Carter</div><div class="rl">Founder &amp; Lead Consultant</div></div>
        <div class="member reveal"><div class="av"><img src="/team-aisha-morgan.png" alt="Aisha Morgan" /></div><div class="nm">Aisha Morgan</div><div class="rl">Head of Market Research</div></div>
        <div class="member reveal"><div class="av"><img src="/team-raj-kapoor.png" alt="Raj Kapoor" /></div><div class="nm">Raj Kapoor</div><div class="rl">Logistics &amp; Compliance Lead</div></div>
        <div class="member reveal"><div class="av"><img src="/team-elena-lopez.png" alt="Elena Lopez" /></div><div class="nm">Elena Lopez</div><div class="rl">Buyer Relations Manager</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaStrip
    title="Is your board receiving enough evidence to govern AI risk?"
    description="Request a briefing for board, CFO, legal, or risk leadership on accountability gaps, human-attribution exposure, and what the operating record can actually prove."
    primaryHref="/request-briefing/"
    primaryLabel="Request a Board Briefing →"
    secondaryHref="/webinar/"
    secondaryLabel="Attend the Webinar"
    paddedTop={false}
  />
</BaseLayout>
